.SH OPTIONS \fI\,'sysforge converge'\/\fR
.TP
\fB\-\-apply\fR
Rebuild all DRIFTED packages with the current profile.

.TP
\fB\-\-state\-dir\fR \fI\,DIR\/\fR
Override state directory for build_state.toml.

.TP
\fB\-\-profile\-conf\fR \fI\,FILE\/\fR
Path to a flag_profiles.toml to use instead of the default.

.TP
\fB\-\-no\-pkg\-log\fR
Disable per\-package log files (only relevant with \-\-apply).

.TP
\fB\-\-persist\-log\fR
Keep log files after successful completion (only relevant with \-\-apply).

.TP
\fB\-\-log\-dir\fR \fI\,DIR\/\fR
Directory for per\-package log files (only relevant with \-\-apply).

.TP
\fB\-\-makepkg\fR \fI\,FLAGS\/\fR, \fB\-m\fR \fI\,FLAGS\/\fR
Extra flags passed to makepkg during \-\-apply rebuilds (e.g. \-m '\-C' to cleanbuild). \-f is always injected
automatically.

.TP
\fB\-\-cache\-report\fR
Print a structured cache summary after \-\-apply runs.

